    "DANGER: Enabling HSTS will force browsers to connect via HTTPS only. If your origin server loses HTTPS support, your site will be inaccessible until the Max-Age expires.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "危险：启用 HSTS 将强制浏览器仅通过 HTTPS 连接。如果源服务器失去 HTTPS 支持，您的网站在最大存活期过期前将无法访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
